      "side": 1,
      "message": "I missed this one earlier. This will break the optimization that render attachments use loadOps instead of `EnsureSubresourceContentInitialized` since `RenderAttachment \u0026 ~kResolveAttachmentLoadingUsage` is `RenderAttachment`. Did you mean to have the condition be:\n\n```\nif (syncInfo.usage \u0026 ~(wgpu::TextureUsage::RenderAttachment | kResolveAttachmentLoadingUsage)) {\n```\n?",
      "revId": "9a198b9dfa49a47144da1dcd9b30c47f5ad78a67",
